  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Apoyo Centro Accin Social por la Msica Fase I</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the Action Social Center of Music Phase I</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SUPPORT TO THE SISTEM OF ORQUESTRAS FOR CHILDREN AND YOUTH IN VENEZUELA. THE PROGRAM HAS TWO COMPONENTS: A) TO BUILD A HEADQUARTERS IN CARACAS CREATING REHEARSAL AND PERFORMANCE ESPACES AND B) TO STRENGHTEN THE SISTEM THROUGH IMPROVING AND SISTEMATIZING THE CURRICULUM; TRAINING TEACHERS AND CONDUCTORS; BUYING ADDITIONAL INSTRUMENTS; DEVELOPING AND IMPLEMENTING A STRATEGY TO FUNDRAISE AMONG OTHERS ACTIVITIES.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
